Negative control for client-notes.lookups.int.test.ts (AC-41 / story AC-2).

Forces the contract-product lookup's boot gate always-on: drops the `&& isActive.value`
deferral from `loadContractProductLookup`'s `enabled`, so the once-minted query fires a
`/contracts_products` request at manager boot instead of staying idle until the control reads
the service. The "fires no contract-products request at boot" assertion
(`observedProducts.count()` === 0) goes red; nothing else references the boot count.

diff --git a/packages/headless/src/modules/client-notes/client-notes.services.ts b/packages/headless/src/modules/client-notes/client-notes.services.ts
